#8901
xorn~
a xorn~
A xorn burrows through solid rock.
~
A xorn burrows swiftly through an outcropping of solid rock, making incredibly
easy work of the task. The gaping three-cornered maw atop its conical head
churns steadily forward, while three stone-lidded eyes, symmetrically
positioned about its narrow head, occasionally blink away the falling rubble.
Directly below each eye, an elephantine foot works steadily to propel its body
further into the massif.
~
