a satyr~
A satyr is here, communing with nature.
~
The head, torso, and arms of a human, combined with the hind of a goat make
the satyr a cunning and agile creature. Sharp black horns jut through the
coarse, curly hair atop his head. Like the sylvan areas in which he dwells,
the satyr is the very personification of nature - the embodiment of all that
is wild and carefree.
~
