#8907
ettercap~
an ettercap~
An ettercap moves lightly through the brush, checking its snares.
~
The ettercap stands nearly six feet tall, even with its stooping gait and
hunched shoulders. It has short, spindly legs, and long arms that reach nearly
to its ankles. Its hands have a thumb and three long fingers that end in
razor-sharp claws. Tufts of wiry, black hair cover its dark, rough skin.
Almost equine in shape, its face is dominated by large reptilian eyes, and
large fangs protrude downward from each side of its mouth.
~
