leprechaun~
a leprechaun~
A leprechaun frolics here.
~
Dancing merrily before you is an odd creature, clad in green, and holding a
long-stemmed pipe and a thick wooden shillelagh. Standing about two feet tall,
and wearing a wide smile on his bearded face... Why, this must be a
leprechaun! Rumored to be a cross between a species of halfling and a strong
strain of pixie, leprechauns are masters of illusion, and are, thus, seldom
seen in these woods.
~
