Mystical floating eyes hover here, conjoined by articulated stalks to a
central probing eye. The mental powers of the gazer, more than make up for its
weak and clumsy physique. Its mesmerizing attack is known to cause permanent
madness to those of low intellect. Its eyes constantly sweep and reach to
provide perfect peripheral vision.
~
